// Task 9 (W1 playable-loop) — ms-repair smoke fixture. A lightFreighter
// flagship docked at Von Braun (so the VB state hangar's repair pool is
// reachable) plus one pre-damaged MS already parked at that depot
// (dockedAt set, no storedOnShip) via the ms[].hullCurrent override. A
// separate fixture from starter-fleet.json5 on purpose — starter-fleet is
// shared by every other MS smoke (ms-custody, ms-sortie-loop, ms-roster-
// scale, ...) and ship-repair.spec.ts already asserts the VB hangar's full
// throughput restores the flagship within a fixed tick budget; adding a
// second damaged repair target to that shared fixture would silently
// split the pool and break that assertion.
